## Core Modules
- `src/cpu/cpu.rs` — `Cpu<L>` main executor
- `src/cpu/executor.rs` — Instruction execution
- `src/cpu/scheduler.rs` — Task scheduling
- `src/hy_evo/` — Evolutionary engine (genome, workflow, mutation)

## Responsibilities
- Route messages from Bus
- Execute skills, tools, and LLM calls
- Run autonomous maintenance via Cron

